<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>For My Love ❤️</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9a9e 0%, #fad0c4 100%);
      color: #333;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      height: 100vh;
      margin: 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .container {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 15px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      max-width: 400px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      color: #ff6f61;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .question {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin: 15px 0;
      color: #555;
    }
    .heart {
      font-size: 3rem;
      color: #ff6f61;
      animation: heartbeat 1.5s infinite;
    }
    @keyframes heartbeat {
      0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
      50% { transform: scale(1.2); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Hey Love ❤️</h1>
    <p>I know things might feel a little tough right now, but I want you to know how much I care about you. Here are a few questions to remind you how amazing you are:</p>
    <div class="question">1. What’s one thing that made you smile today?</div>
    <div class="question">2. What’s your favorite way to relax when you’re feeling low?</div>
    <div class="question">3. What’s something you’re proud of yourself for?</div>
    <div class="question">4. What’s one thing you’re looking forward to?</div>
    <p>Remember, you’re strong, beautiful, and loved. Always. 💕</p>
    <div class="heart">❤️</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
